<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Em breve | Fênix Dança de Salão</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/icons8-fenix-cute-color-70.png" type="image/png">
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #231313;
            --muted: #6f5b56;
            --paper: #fff8f4;
            --line: rgba(102, 42, 42, 0.16);
            --red: #b9272f;
            --red-dark: #7f1721;
            --teal: #0d9488;
            --gold: #f59e0b;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        html { min-height: 100%; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            color: var(--ink);
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(185, 39, 47, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(185, 39, 47, 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(135deg, #f2dfd4, #fff8f4 55%, #e2f1ed);
            background-size: 32px 32px, 32px 32px, auto;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
        }

        .topbar,
        .footer {
            width: min(960px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .topbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 24px 0 0;
        }

        .brand {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--ink);
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .brand img { width: 42px; height: 42px; object-fit: contain; }

        .back-link,
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 44px;
            padding: 0 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .back-link,
        .btn-secondary {
            color: var(--ink);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .back-link:hover,
        .btn-secondary:hover,
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(65, 31, 31, 0.12);
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            padding: 36px 16px 48px;
        }

        .construction-card {
            width: min(960px, 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 48px 36px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(65, 31, 31, 0.14);
        }

        .construction-card::before,
        .footer::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--teal), var(--gold), var(--red));
        }

        .construction-card::before { top: 0; }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: var(--red-dark);
            background: rgba(185, 39, 47, 0.1);
            font-size: 0.76rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.12em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0 0 12px;
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
            line-height: 1.05;
        }

        .subheading {
            margin: 0 auto 24px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.12rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .main-image {
            position: relative;
            width: min(540px, 100%);
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
        }

        .main-image svg {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            max-height: 330px;
        }

        .text {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            color: var(--muted);
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; }

        .btn-primary {
            color: #fff;
            background: var(--red);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 26px rgba(185, 39, 47, 0.2);
        }

        .footer {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 24px 0 28px;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.86rem;
        }

        .footer::before { top: 0; }
        .footer p { margin: 0; }

        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .topbar { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
            .topbar, .footer { width: min(100% - 24px, 960px); }
            .construction-card { padding: 40px 20px 30px; }
            .main-image { width: min(100%, 420px); }
            .actions { flex-direction: column; }
            .btn { width: 100%; }
            .footer { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="topbar">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
            <img src="/images/icons8-fenix-cute-color-70.png" alt="Fênix">
            <span>Fênix Dança de Salão</span>
        </a>
        <a class="back-link" href="/">Voltar</a>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section class="construction-card" aria-labelledby="page-title">
            <span class="badge">Área em construção</span>
            <h1 id="page-title">Em breve</h1>
            <p class="subheading">Novas funções do sistema de avaliação serão publicadas aqui.</p>

            <div class="main-image" aria-label="Ilustração de uma estação de trabalho em construção" role="img">
                <%- svg %>
            </div>

            <p class="text">
                Enquanto isso, use <strong>Acessar Salas</strong> ou o
                <strong>Painel administrativo</strong> para continuar.
            </p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">Voltar ao início</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/avaliacao">Acessar Salas</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/admin/login">Painel administrativo</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <p>Fênix Dança de Salão</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Sistema de Avaliação</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
